{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "9b0f1a17602a2ec48dbcbc380e40b7f382aefbafe32a0eb0d1508b771a9e2674", "ja": "はじまりの場所で", "zh": "在起始之地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "324480d317082b0d5dff22563ce6644758d2d86672646d2d24d258608a082c30", "ja": "行きたい場所に悩んだ未来は、なんの変哲も\nない道にふたりを連れていく。そこはプロデ\nューサーと最初に出会った場所。3人は劇場\nでの日々を振り返りながら、アイドルの楽し\nさや大事なものが増えていたことに気づく。", "zh": "苦恼于不知去哪里的未来，带着两人走上了一条再普通不过的路。那里正是与制作人初次相遇的地方。3人一边回顾在剧场度过的日子，一边意识到，偶像带来的乐趣和珍贵的事物都在不断增加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e2da9d1721831335e0589982bb060759a946e40135b2d3bf16e5e549d49d7211", "ja": "（あれから未来達のレッスンは順調に進んでいる。\nPRライブの詳細がきたから伝えないとな！）", "zh": "（从那以后，未来她们的训练都进行得很顺利。PR演出的详细安排来了，得告诉她们才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "285ece4e4445ef307ac3d14e9d1af780731dc848084a7e92b9677e2de12425d7", "ja": "今日のレッスンも楽しかった～！\n先生も順調だって言ってたし、私たちバッチリだね！", "zh": "今天的练习也好开心～！\n老师也说进展顺利，我们三个配合得棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "83f8194e8fb6cecc1ea00c8c98e7b5b93b9d2c83d17c99d74eabdb760374eac7", "ja": "うんうん。\n3人の動きが揃うとことか、気持ちよかった～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯。3个人的动作整齐一致时，感觉真棒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "1e4efb8dbf721d3b87b6c6a8dfa9d15de96e79fda9ec2675d6278353dbdf3667", "ja": "そういえば未来、行き先は決まった？\n今日は未来の好きな場所に行くはずでしょ？", "zh": "对了，未来，决定好要去哪儿了吗？\n今天不是应该去你喜欢的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "19cda8b6f30a027a0890cd10b95510cbc4b689f9d01043b3e210d4c1386e891a", "ja": "あっ、うん。\nそれが、まだ決まってなくて。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n那个……还没决定好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1005_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4dc8f0ca8695eb11a32566f35746b9b10d5225e0021a303be96151a7b35be209", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "大家，辛苦了。\n状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6628f5e2cccdb38f3621ff289bfb7132e257efd793b3e4659fcb9f4e4063089", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでーす♪\n先生に「すごくいいよ」って褒められちゃいました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～♪\n老师夸我“表现得非常好”了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1395684cad3c0584f393d64eb52a19af9069ab4dd673ca7bdaf63205f97fc0fb", "ja": "そうか、順調みたいでよかった。\nさっき事前に行われるPRライブの詳細がきたんだ。", "zh": "这样啊，看来进展顺利，真是太好了。\n刚才收到了事前举行的宣传演出的详细安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b71ec1b19130dc0c3ecb78d9b326f158efbc412c6010664f6ac748733a856ac3", "ja": "他の事務所からも何人かアイドルが参加するようだ。\nみんな『なんどでも笑おう』も歌うことになる。", "zh": "听说其他事务所也会有几位偶像参加。\n大家到时候都要唱《一次又一次地欢笑》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "733fc16eb0b885922e4bd25a93612cb5be1161d4d89eecd6cd770085eb8e4bde", "ja": "やっぱり、そうなんですね。みんなで同じ歌を……。\nなら、もう少し歌いこんだ方がいいのかも。", "zh": "果然是这样啊。大家要唱同一首歌……  \n那看来，还是得再多练习一会儿才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "993f46632ed9a1b947025fa1cae8d85169b304c902b0cd7c1edb9a992c7e313a", "ja": "えー、大丈夫だと思うけどなぁ。\nじゃあ多数決で！　ね、未来？", "zh": "诶——我觉得应该没问题吧。\n那就投票决定！对吧，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "9a4ee32f8e26cf1a2da39e1a96bca421e4af7bd4161827fa4b03307bfdb83c4f", "ja": "ん～……うーん……？", "zh": "嗯～……唔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f2e4709b602e0cbd00e6278b2ac263903629ba5a8a94a33aaec55d1a60a11bd9", "ja": "ん？　どうした、未来？\nなんだか難しい顔して……。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，未来？\n一脸严肃的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bd2021dfefb349c64857527ec79a1e7d00214e38c67eafdda51aa313f6a3aac6", "ja": "あ、そっか。わたし達、このあと遊びに行く予定で、\n未来は行き先を考えてるんだと思いま～す。", "zh": "啊，对了。我们接下来打算出去玩，我想未来是在考虑要去哪里～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "d6017d4fb8e327799fe57773dc953bd7ebb11b559012eb1eab4078b62aedf9dc", "ja": "そうなんですよ～。\n行きたい場所がたくさんあって、決められなくて……。", "zh": "就是这样～有好多想去的地方，实在决定不下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2b5d7b3b69f2746a6a6be87e8a82e9f63916c19375a2b1072bdf8608c0879493", "ja": "そうなのか？　うーん、そうだな。\nじゃあ、ここはひとつ……。", "zh": "是这样吗？嗯……那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "c629d3bf256b99e5dea028d3984ac7310e3cbff3de93cca477e24ff02833d5c1", "ja": "あっ、あそこだ！\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，就在那里！\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5a442090d355d93593f0925191fc0a2952883f7a6f869d629a23e6a267af842a", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうか。\nまあ……どういたしまして？", "zh": "诶？是、是吗。\n嗯……不、不用谢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "d80e747c12d7e21e921e5399839388e74672e2b83bee2219726bee8ebdbe9ee0", "ja": "静香ちゃん、翼！\n着替えが終わったら、劇場の前に集合ね！", "zh": "静香、翼！\n换好衣服后，在剧场门口集合哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "22ad06854daf485065a5ee5672734e723fbe066457087215d401eb2d7e55ff33", "ja": "う、うん。いいけど……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。是可以啦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "c9e9ea6b462636cdaaf3d491b165b49b5b163c05d6f48e5cf7ed5dd672e14621", "ja": "未来、どこまで行くつもりなの？\nあまり遠い所だと、帰りが遅くなっちゃうんじゃ……。", "zh": "未来，你打算走到哪里去？\n要是去太远的地方，回来不会很晚吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "74e25b94a40acd8b9defa92d446689fb777e414f927a30c5d930a24b30ca5f4b", "ja": "はい、ここが私の、すっごく来たかった場所！", "zh": "是的，这里就是我一直特别想来的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3aeb189e780eeb7c62bcd83ecb0f92e13b747743bd834cbdfaceaa13375fc46b", "ja": "えっ？　ここだよ、って……。\nただの道じゃない？", "zh": "咦？就是这里啊……不就是一条普通的路吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "ac736dc7b6be51aa2a35de475be1a1a22bd4f0573aea87aa8bf4e73118a5b92d", "ja": "うん、ただの道だよ。{$P$}さんを\n見て思い出したんだ♪　私の始まりの、ただの道！", "zh": "嗯，就是一条普通的马路哦。看到{$P$}先生\n就想起来了♪　我开始的地方，一条普通的马路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e45cf629d1b75f487b9f7e96896e116b5ee93188c50db641d0b33a0eeddd214", "ja": "私、デビュー前にここで、\n{$P$}さんとぶつかっちゃったの。", "zh": "我在出道前，在这里\n跟{$P$}先生撞上了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "02e5e36c2ac78f17759387d67c789a61181b43a487f63c01a7ac9f42d833e93b", "ja": "あ、確かよそ見してて、{$P$}に\nぶつかったんだっけ？　しかも自転車で。", "zh": "啊，我记得你当时是因为东张西望，骑着自行车撞上了{$P$}吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6356c1c27db8ee59fdf90ceec50ef44d41262d4cf5f828943574d21b7f927d96", "ja": "でも、それでオーディションに誘われたんでしょ？\nあはっ、少女マンガみたーい♪", "zh": "不过，也正因为这样才被邀请参加试镜的吧？\n啊哈，简直就像少女漫画一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e04dd0dea74729ac83691a05ada4c5fce8d72c4a8256ba4d7e89fa9c9d5cf00", "ja": "うん……私、アイドルは大好きだったけど……。\n自分がなるなんて、考えたことなかったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……我虽然很喜欢偶像……\n但从没想过自己也能去当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ded2587a1249d2895fc0e2b0ff0d9af13ccc68e6ef10caad579360a1b52dd07", "ja": "だから、{$P$}さんの話を聞いて、\nすっっっごくドキドキして、ワクワクしたの！", "zh": "所以，听到关于{$P$}先生的事情后，我特别特别心动，又期待又兴奋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "de97b7322affff747a415e7c75ca016101e1e793b0ebd4dedf85e40ff200e958", "ja": "わたしも、アイドルになったらモテモテになれるって、\nドキドキしてたっけな～。", "zh": "我当时也想着，成为偶像后就能变得超受欢迎，心里又紧张又期待～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b26f0315f3a3b49a34f8b204694eccc2cd215e18796131c8f619350b2f3a6c28", "ja": "でも……今はもっとドキドキしてる。\nアイドルになった頃より、ずーっと！", "zh": "不过……我现在更心跳加速了。\n比刚成为偶像那会儿，还要更加心动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ff3daf70d252ec9b7d18b3bf1aa2a4be381b163328d65dd4348ca7a13fa5639", "ja": "翼……やっぱり、最近少し変わったわね。\nレッスン嫌いは相変わらずみたいだけど！", "zh": "翼……你果然最近有点变了呢。讨厌练习这一点倒是一如既往！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a478d885bd0d7127dad462547985bce300395e7eb3fc60d2d225789ec22f49ee", "ja": "ツラいのは嫌いだもーん。でも、ちょっとぐらいなら\n頑張れるよ？　ステージに出るの、楽しいから！", "zh": "我才不喜欢辛苦的事嘛。不过，稍微努力一下还是做得到的哦？因为登上舞台很开心嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "4352fec6bb5de8e548097771cbbfe5a94920767dfca59217b9da742162ad5494", "ja": "静香ちゃんはどう？　アイドルになって……\nそれから、何に一番ドキドキしたの？", "zh": "静香呢？成为偶像之后……\n然后，最让你心跳加速的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "575f037c391b9b8a6542e54d038fea6c7a446c48f7ec171ea0b6562e51a54a78", "ja": "一番かぁ。そうね……。出たステージ、\n参加したユニット、歌った曲……。うん、全部！", "zh": "要说最让人心动的啊。这个嘛……登上的舞台、参加的组合、唱过的歌曲……嗯，全部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8846dbf0976d24695a35a808a5f062e2c179c920f64ee501d3cfd7053a28478d", "ja": "あはっ、静香ちゃん欲張り～！", "zh": "啊哈哈，静香真贪心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "dde7ba9e6e735faa3c73d918478fa4cba3b8cdb390bfc57bb81be2eca749359b", "ja": "だ、だって本当だもの！　私にとっては……今までの、\nアイドルとしての全部が、大事だから。", "zh": "因、因为这是真的嘛！对我来说……迄今为止作为偶像的一切，都很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "a4de22dad5e63086d0264fb46b151d9359d8400bb65174d2de86d4cb4bc56dc6", "ja": "ステージも、ファンの人たちも、仲間も……それに、\n友達も。劇場のアイドルとしての毎日が、全部大事！", "zh": "舞台也好、粉丝们也好、伙伴们也好……还有，\n朋友们也是。作为剧场偶像的每一天，全都很重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "11e10c61ba0d294b4bedfd2c33a8f3e89acd4c5dbdae2811ca44f43820b78398", "ja": "……つまり、私たちが大事ってことだよね！？\nでへへ、ありがと～♪", "zh": "……也就是说，我们也很重要对吧！？\n嘿嘿嘿，谢谢你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "68748b0f8dfd518b5ac37efc2c1dab5207543c9adb000424be8d51394242b3a5", "ja": "そういう意味じゃ……、ない、こともないか。だって\n未来がいて、翼がいたから、今の私がいるんだもん。", "zh": "并不是那个意思……倒也不能说完全不是。因为有未来，还有翼，所以才有现在的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "434de341e3542dd06885604cfc7a918a37be89bb8bb41710341f36db7b3d71c8", "ja": "そうだよねー。わたし達と、劇場のみんなと。\nあ、それから{$P$}さん！", "zh": "对吧——我们，还有剧场的大家。啊，还有{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "a3009fd4af58a92fe7a1c256bae55bdaab37a9072e457d0b8bc7becd0e6442f9", "ja": "そうだよ！　{$P$}さんがいたから、\n私たちはアイドルになれたんだよね！", "zh": "就是这样！因为有了{$P$}先生，我们才能成为偶像，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4966b879216024b4d9ecfe2d274975fcd8630071a4a78ed4e09b0c35db69e8d9", "ja": "当たり前のコトなのに、なんか思い出しちゃった感じ♪\n{$P$}さんに言ったら喜びそう♪", "zh": "明明是理所当然的事情，却突然回想起来了呢♪\n要是跟{$P$}先生说了，他一定会很高兴吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a929de0d42e7edd7bccd52da1fe28a5281712bd73d552168594d9e4965d398d", "ja": "でも、そんなこと、今さら言わないわよね？\nだって急に言ったら変だし……恥ずかしいし。", "zh": "不过，那种话，现在才不会说吧？\n毕竟突然说出来很奇怪……也很害羞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_05_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "52ffaac9a79021218447d37f3bd297dfea6a0646f0d3c77ad3e9f433c326bffb", "ja": "え～、そうかな～？　でも、そっかぁ。\nうーん、それじゃあ～……。", "zh": "诶～，是这样吗～？不过，原来如此。\n嗯——那就……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
